cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >
  If you use FeuPy Data in your research, please cite this data release
  and the original references associated with the datasets used.

title: "FeuPy Data: Auxiliary datasets for FeuPy"

type: dataset

authors:
  - family-names: "Costa Jr."
    given-names: "Rubens"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2893-7589"

  - family-names: "dos Anjos"
    given-names: "Rita C."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6463-2272"

version: "1.0"

repository-code: "https://github.com/rubensjrcosta/feupy-data"

license: "BSD-3-Clause"

keywords:
  - gamma rays
  - very-high-energy astrophysics
  - source catalogs
  - instrument response functions
  - reproducibility
  - FeuPy

abstract: >
  FeuPy Data is the auxiliary data repository for FeuPy. It provides
  versioned gamma-ray source catalogs, data products associated with
  dedicated scientific publications, instrument response functions,
  metadata, and supporting files used by FeuPy analyses. The repository
  is maintained separately from the FeuPy source code to preserve
  reproducibility and allow software and dataset versions to evolve
  independently.

